error[E0176]: 'sqlValue' cannot turn 'Plain' into a 'std/sql' 'Value'
  --> check_sql_value_bad_type.bit:14:3
   |
14 |   sqlValue(p)
   |   ^^^^^^^^^^^ 'sqlValue<V>' accepts 'string', 'int'/'i64', 'bool', 'f64', '[]byte', or 'Option<>' of one of those — wrap 'Plain' yourself with the matching 'Value' variant instead
